Description: AI-powered man page viewer for deepin
 deepin-iman is a man page browser that deeply integrates AI capabilities
 with traditional man page experience. It allows users to browse, search,
 and navigate all man pages, and leverages AI to provide Chinese translation,
 usage examples, command Q&A, and command parsing.
 .
 Key features:
  * Full-text search across all man pages (SQLite FTS5)
  * Cross-reference navigation (SEE ALSO links)
  * AI-powered translation (multi-provider: OpenAI/Claude/Qwen/GLM)
  * Chinese + English side-by-side view
  * AI-generated usage examples
  * Embedded terminal
  * Cheat sheet generation
  * Learning history with AI weekly reports
